        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alex Wyse\n- TV Series: Iron Fist, The Bold and the Beautiful, The Defenders\n- Films/Franchises: Marvel Cinematic Universe\n- Plays/Musicals: Spring Awakening\n- Roles: Kyle, Saul Feinberg, Georg Zirschnitz\n\nFacts:\n- In 2015, Alex Wyse played Georg Zirschnitz in the Deaf West Broadway revival of Spring Awakening.\n- Alex Wyse is best known for playing Kyle in Iron Fist, Saul Feinberg in The Bold and the Beautiful, and Georg Zirschnitz in Spring Awakening.\n- Iron Fist is set in the Marvel Cinematic Universe and shares continuity with the franchise's films.\n- Iron Fist is the fourth in a series of shows that lead to The Defenders crossover miniseries.",
